","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dbeallor/album-ranker/commits{/sha}","git_commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dbeallor/album-ranker/git/commits{/sha}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dbeallor/album-ranker/comments{/number}","issue_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dbeallor/album-ranker/issues/comments{/number}","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dbeallor/album-ranker/contents/{+path}","compare_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dbeallor/album-ranker/compare/{base}...{head}","merges_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dbeallor/album-ranker/merges","archive_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dbeallor/album-ranker/{archive_format}{/ref}","downloads_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dbeallor/album-ranker/downloads","issues_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dbeallor/album-ranker/issues{/number}","pulls_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dbeallor/album-ranker/pulls{/number}","milestones_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dbeallor/album-ranker/milestones{/number}","notifications_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dbeallor/album-ranker/notifications{?since,all,participating}","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dbeallor/album-ranker/labels{/name}","releases_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dbeallor/album-ranker/releases{/id}","deployments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dbeallor/album-ranker/deployments","created_at":"2026-11-20T22:59:28Z","updated_at":"2026-11-21T05:16:45Z","pushed_at":"2026-11-21T06:05:38Z","git_url":"git://github.com/dbeallor/album-ranker.git","ssh_url":"git@github.com:dbeallor/album-ranker.git","clone_url":"https://github.com/dbeallor/album-ranker.git","svn_url":"https://github.com/dbeallor/album-ranker","homepage":null,"size":164,"stargazers_count":0,"watchers_count":0,"language":"TypeScript","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":false,"has_wiki":true,"has_pages":false,"has_discussions":false,"forks_count":0,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":11,"license":null,"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"has_pull_requests":true,"pull_request_creation_policy":"all","topics":[],"visibility":"public","forks":0,"open_issues":11,"watchers":0,"default_branch":"main","permissions":{"admin":true,"maintain":true,"push":true,"triage":true,"pull":true}},"body":"Make it a documented, repeatable step to run the app locally in two ways: a main preview built from the `main` branch, and a preview of any ticket's branch on its own local port, side by side.\n\n## Today\n- The only documented way to run the app is `npm run dev` on port 3000 from one checkout (README \"Run the app\"). Nothing says how to preview a branch next to main.\n- Ticket branches already live in separate git worktrees (`git worktree list` shows one per ticket under `~/.t3/worktrees/album-ranker/`), but nothing starts the app from them.\n- `package.json` has `dev`, `build` and `start` scripts that take Next's default port. No script or doc sets a port.\n- The SQLite path comes from `DATABASE_PATH` in `lib/config.ts`, defaulting to `./data/album-ranker.db` relative to the working directory. A worktree gets its own `data/` folder by default, which is gitignored. Nothing documents this or how a preview should seed data.\n- `.env*` is gitignored except `.env.example`, so each checkout needs its own `.env`.\n\n## Scope\n- Main preview: a documented command or script that runs the app from the `main` branch (root checkout, which stays on `main`) on a fixed port, and how to refresh it after a merge.\n- Ticket preview: a documented command or script that takes a ticket number or branch, finds its worktree, and runs the app from it on a different local port. Several ticket previews can run at once.\n- Port scheme: one fixed port for main and a rule for choosing a ticket's port, so two previews never collide. Fail with a clear message when a port is taken.\n- Data: each preview uses its own `DATABASE_PATH`, so a branch's migrations never touch the main preview's data. Say how to start empty or copy the main file.\n- Setup per worktree is covered: install dependencies and create `.env` when missing.\n- A way to stop a preview.\n- Document it in the README, and note it in `docs/agents/project.md` § Environments and deploy.\n\n## Acceptance\n- One command starts the main preview on its fixed port, serving `main`.\n- One command per ticket starts a preview of that ticket's branch on a different port while the main preview keeps running.\n- Changing data in a ticket preview does not change the main preview's data.\n- The README steps work from a fresh checkout with a ticket worktree.\n- Nothing from `data/` or `.env` is committed.\n\n## Out of scope\n- Deploying the app anywhere (see #14).\n- Browser test runs and event capture (see #19).\n- A shared or hosted preview URL, and CI preview builds.\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dbeallor/album-ranker/issues/20/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dbeallor/album-ranker/issues/20/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"id":36841019410,"node_id":"LE_lADOV2EaVs8AAAABhO1Rq88AAAAIk-VYEg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dbeallor/album-ranker/issues/events/36841019410","actor":{"login":"dbeallor","id":25851246,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1ODUxMjQ2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25851246?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dbeallor","html_url":"https://github.com/dbeallor","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dbeallor/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dbeallor/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dbeallor/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dbeallor/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.c